# SEO, AEO, and GEO

When the task changes discoverability, answers, or machine-readable exports, read the matching skill before editing:

- **SEO** — `.cursor/skills/notofilia-seo/SKILL.md`
- **AEO** — `.cursor/skills/notofilia-aeo/SKILL.md`
- **GEO** — `.cursor/skills/notofilia-geo/SKILL.md`

Shared limits: no prices or invented facts; `TODO(owner)` never renders; Spanish URLs are canonical `x-default`; keep JSON-LD `@id` values `#website`, `#organization`, and `#yezid-acosta`. Page-type schema in `.cursor/rules/10-page-types.mdc` wins over a second copy of the same graph.
